# read_file of an image: the model calls it on shot.png and the result
# attaches the picture (the request after it carries it), then on a PNG
# header 9000 pixels wide, which is not attached and says why. The catalog
# tags the model for images. `wide.png` is made at launch.
models models-image.json
gateway image-readfile-turns.json
work image-ws
pnghdr wide.png 9000 10
wait 5
type what is in the picture?
key Enter
wait 5
snap read
type and the wide one?
key Enter
wait 5
snap wide
gwlog
